# Valinz.com — Interactive Portfolio Terminal

## Overview
This repository contains the **open-source code** for my personal website, [Valinz.com](https://valinz.com).  
It features a fully custom **terminal-style interface** built from scratch using **HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript**.  

Users can interact with the page using simple terminal commands to explore sections such as:
- `!welcome` — Introduction  
- `!about` — About Me  
- `!cv` — Resume & Credentials  
- `!fost` — My 446whp Focus ST Build  
- `!portfolio` — Coding Projects  

The goal of this project is to merge **technical design** with **aesthetics** — giving visitors an engaging, hacker-style interface to explore my portfolio.

